<figure class="composition-figure not-prose my-10 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)]">
  <header class="border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <p class="font-editorial-mono m-0 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--accent)]">Declarative product composition</p>
      <span class="font-editorial-mono rounded-full border border-[var(--accent-border)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--accent)]">Conceptual</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="font-display mt-2 mb-0 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">Compose from trusted capabilities instead of inventing behavior.</h3>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Engineering supplies the real capabilities and constraints. Authored product knowledge contributes intent, relevance, prerequisites, and composition guidance.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="px-4 py-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Current state</p>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Restricted account; identity verification missing; no active risk review.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Available capabilities</p>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Customer profile, account status, transactions, identity verification, restriction action, risk escalation.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Authored product knowledge</p>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Purpose: investigate a restricted account. Explain blocked actions through their unmet prerequisites.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Deterministic policy</p>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Restriction removal requires verified identity. Risk escalation remains permitted while restricted. Authorization and mutation stay in application code.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex justify-center py-1">
      <div class="h-5 w-px bg-[var(--border-strong)]"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-md border border-[var(--accent-border)] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] px-4 py-3 text-center">
      <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--accent)]">Context / composition layer</p>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-primary)]">Select relevant capabilities, order the task, apply guidance, respect state and policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex justify-center py-1">
      <div class="h-5 w-px bg-[var(--border-strong)]"></div>
    </div>

    <section class="overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-[var(--border-strong)]" aria-label="Illustrative derived account review surface">
      <header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] px-4 py-3">
        <div>
          <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Derived surface</p>
          <h4 class="font-display mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Account Review</h4>
        </div>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-[var(--accent-border)] px-2.5 py-1 font-editorial-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--accent)]">Restricted</span>
      </header>

      <ul class="divide-y divide-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-primary)]">
        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Customer profile</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-primary)]">Jordan Rivera</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Recent transactions</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-primary)]">3 entries, 1 blocked transfer</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Restriction reason</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-primary)]">Identity verification required</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Request verification</span>
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)]">Prerequisite for removal</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Remove restriction</span>
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--text-muted)] line-through decoration-[var(--text-muted)]">Blocked: prerequisite unmet</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5">
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Escalate to risk</span>
          <span class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)]">Permitted</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] px-4 py-2.5 font-editorial-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">State, authorization, and side effects remain owned by deterministic systems.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-4 py-3 text-[10px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:px-6">
    The authored product-knowledge layer did not implement verification, authorization, transaction retrieval, account mutation, or escalation. Those are engineering-built capabilities. The composition layer uses intent, current state, deterministic policy, and available capabilities to shape the surface.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

